# <%= current_page.data.title %>

A single view of Common Platform (Crime Live, MPD) connectivity to external services: PSN / CJSE, Courtstore, DARTS, XHIBIT, GOV.UK Notify, Libra GoB and DCS. These paths are needed to restore Common Platform services, so this page records what each connection is, how traffic flows, how it's managed, and its known risks.

**Scope:** subscription `Strategic Platform - live` (`9ab65d81-930d-4cc0-a93d-367e14676bc0`), tenant `cp.cjs.hmcts.net`. Traffic figures reflect the state as of the last review (2 November 2026).

