## Summary

| Connection | Edge component | Path | Status | Change in flight |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| PSN – CJSE in/out | `MPDIMZPSNP01` (HAProxy VM) | VPN → Cloud Gateway → PSN | Live, in use | Move to AppGW **started, stalled** (DTSPO-25472, DTSPO-27156) |
| Courtstore | `MPDIMZPSNP01` (HAProxy VM, mTLS) | NGF → Internet → CACI (AWS) | Live, in use | Direct APIM → Courtstore route configured but **not yet in use** (traffic still goes via the VM) |
| DARTS | `GW-MPD-IMZ-APPGW-OUT` | VPN → Cloud Gateway → HMCTS SDS | Live, migrated | Complete |
| XHIBIT | `MPDIMZXHBT01` (FTPS/SFTP/HTTPS VM) | VPN → Cloud Gateway → BAIS (HMCTS Azure) | Live, in use | Not found |
| GOV.UK Notify | `MPDIMZOPROXY01` (squid VM) | Public IP → Internet | Live, in use | Not found |
| Libra GoB | `MPDIMZFTPS01` (HAProxy VM) | VPN → Cloud Gateway → Interim Hosting | Live, in use | Moved to a **real-time API via APIM**; FTPS box to be **decommissioned soon** |

